// come from the same water_quality row. A row counts for a parameter only when
// both values are present and inside the physical range used by
// "Validation Data" (pH 0–14, TDS ≥ 0, turbidity ≥ 0); other rows are counted
// as excluded.
// SD = sample standard deviation (STDDEV_SAMP, divisor n − 1).
// Fluctuation = mean |xᵢ − xᵢ₋₁| over consecutive valid readings of the same
// device, ordered by timestamp, id (MySQL 8 LAG). A step counts only when both
